# Terraform artifacts - never commit these
# terraform.tfvars contains real secrets (Coolify + GitHub tokens)
# *.tfstate can also contain secrets and machine-specific data
# .terraform/ is a provider binary cache; regenerated by `terraform init`
# .terraform.lock.hcl IS tracked (pins provider versions) - do NOT ignore it

terraform.tfvars
terraform.tfvars.json
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform/
tfplan
